{title: Un Vizhigalil}
{artist: Maan Karate Anirudh Ravichander}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Un Vizhigalil Vizhuntha Naatkalil Naan,        Tholainthathu Athuve Pothume
Ethuvum Vendame Penne,        Un Uyirinil Kalantha Naatkalil Naan
Karainthathu Athuve Pothumeve,        Vera Ethuvum Vendame Penne
[G]En Kanavinil Vantha Kaathali [C]ye,        [G]Kan Vizhipathirkule Vanthaa [C]ye
[G]Naan Thedi Thedithaan [C]Alanjuten,        En [F]Devathaya Kandu Pudi [C]chiten
Naan [F]Muzhusa Ennathaan [Dm]Koduthuten,        Naa [F]Unna Vaangiten
[G]Nee Thenam [Dm]Sirichaa Pothu [G]me,        Vera [Dm]Ethuvum Vena [C]me Naan Vaazha [G]ve
[G]Naan Unna [Dm]Rasicha Pothu [G]me,        Vera [Dm]Ethuvum Vena [C]me Naan Vaazha [G]ve
[G]Kaatru Veesum [F]Thisai Ellam,        [G]Nee Pesum Satham [F]Ketene
[C]Naan Kaatraai Maari Povene [G]Anbe
